    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1718271926\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1718271926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1718271926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/3942171ca048fc999fd7c6711e7eeb6c.poster.avif?t=1718271926\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/3942171ca048fc999fd7c6711e7eeb6c.webm?t=1718271926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/3942171ca048fc999fd7c6711e7eeb6c.mp4?t=1718271926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/811c9218c8e469db0ebafe081fa9ecdc.avif?t=1718271926\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Pneumatic Panic is a physics-based chaotic co-op road trip game for one to four players.  Working as a team, you and your fellow companions must arrive at the campgrounds with your supplies, avoiding obstacles along the way.<br><br>Coordinate your efforts by completing contextual events. Avoid logs and wildlife, forage for fruit, close doors to prevent the loss of luggage, and pump up deflated tires. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/cc4c3cb2347321ae4fbaaa6d4a3e5647.poster.avif?t=1718271926\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/cc4c3cb2347321ae4fbaaa6d4a3e5647.webm?t=1718271926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/cc4c3cb2347321ae4fbaaa6d4a3e5647.mp4?t=1718271926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/6242ef44265eee75451997d4a3478ae0.avif?t=1718271926\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Player task allocation is based on the number of players. In this way, a 3-player experience varies significantly from that of a 4-player experience. <br>For repeatable group interaction with variety:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Players take turns directing the vehicle<br></li><li>Contextual pickups &amp; hazards  <br></li><li>2, 3 or 4-player Co-Op<br></li><li>Group Challenges</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/68226e58ef34ed2aede2c106fb62da63.avif?t=1718271926\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Camping supplies are on the roof rack and in the car.  Depending on a number of factors, they can slide and fall off/out:<br>- Speed<br>- Elevation<br>- Running over obstacles<br>- Hitting Wildlife<br>- Low tire pressure (lopsided) <br>- Angle <br><br>Try to get to the campground with as much of your equipment as you can!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1718271926\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1718271926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1718271926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/3942171ca048fc999fd7c6711e7eeb6c.poster.avif?t=1718271926\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/3942171ca048fc999fd7c6711e7eeb6c.webm?t=1718271926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/3942171ca048fc999fd7c6711e7eeb6c.mp4?t=1718271926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916290/extras/811c9218c8e469db0ebafe081fa9ecdc.avif?t=1718271926\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Pneumatic Panic is a physics-based chaotic co-op road trip game for one to four players.  Working as a team, you and your fellow companions must arrive at the campgrounds with your supplies, avoiding obstacles along the way.<br><br>Coordinate your efforts by completing contextual events. Avoid logs and wildlife, forage for fruit, close doors to prevent the loss of luggage, and pump up deflated tires. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"